// why 9:32: the call to ??
// A hole standing as a stage of a pipe is the callee of the call the pipe
// completes, so the caret's Why at the hole names that call by the hole's own
// spelling. Pin e99f1621510b printed "the call to <expr>", a placeholder no
// reader can act on.
fn double(x: Int) -> Int = x * 2

// The hole is the first of the two stages.
fn twice(x: Int) -> Int = x |> ?? |> double
